---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Activation and subscriptions" description="How to activate Homi applications using signed license files.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Activation support</span><h1>Activation and subscriptions</h1><p class="lead">Homi applications are activated and renewed using signed files issued by the Homi team.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content"><div class="container content-narrow">
    <h2>Activation steps</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open the activation screen in the application and create a <code>.hreq</code> request file on the device you want to activate.</li>
      <li>Send the request file to Homi support through WhatsApp or the agreed contact method.</li>
      <li>The Homi team reviews the request, confirms the subscription plan and amount, and verifies receipt of payment before issuing a paid license.</li>
      <li>The team sends you a <code>.hlic</code> license file bound to your device.</li>
      <li>Open the activation screen, choose “Import license file”, and select the received <code>.hlic</code> file.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="notice"><strong>The application does not need an internet connection to activate.</strong> Creating the request file, importing the license, and verifying its signature are performed locally. Internet or messaging is only needed to exchange the files with Homi support.</div>
    <h2>Subscription terms</h2>
    <ul><li>Monthly: 30 days.</li><li>Annual: 365 days.</li><li>Lifetime: use of the purchased application version; future updates and support are separate services.</li></ul>
    <h2>Payment</h2>
    <p>Agree on the amount and payment method directly with Homi support. A paid license is not issued or renewed until the team confirms receipt of payment.</p>
    <h2>Send your request file</h2>
    <p>Attach your <code>.hreq</code> file to a message sent to the official support number. Do not share request or license files publicly.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="https://wa.me/2490904697455?text=I%20would%20like%20to%20activate%20Homi%20Grocery.%20I%20will%20attach%20my%20.hreq%20activation%20request%20file." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Contact Homi on WhatsApp</a></p>
    <p><a class="button button-secondary" href="tel:+2490904697455">+249 090 469 7455</a></p>
    <p class="muted">A license file is bound to the device that created the request file. Do not modify its contents or share it with another user.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
